---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import FitServicesStudio from '../../components/fitcheck/FitServicesStudio.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Garden Fit — Sheds, Gazebos, Greenhouses and Patio Layouts — Fitwise.stream"
  description="Compare garden structures, actual gazebo post spans, shed storage, greenhouse staging and outdoor equipment using your measured plot dimensions."
  noindex
>
  <section class="page-heading wrapper">
    <p class="eyebrow">Garden Fit</p>
    <h1>What can fit in your garden space?</h1>
    <p>
      Check structure body and roof footprints, maintenance/access space, gazebo interior spans,
      shed storage and greenhouse staging. Enter the usable dimensions you measured, not just an
      advertised structure size.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="wrapper section">
    <FitServicesStudio category="garden" initialMode="garden-structure" />
    <section class="garden-services" aria-labelledby="garden-services-heading">
      <h2 id="garden-services-heading">Garden fit services</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Shed, gazebo/pergola and garden-office footprint in a usable plot, including reverse
          candidate-size comparison.
        </li>
        <li>Dining table and chair envelopes inside actual gazebo post-to-post spans.</li>
        <li>Repeated-item, single-layer storage estimate inside a shed with an aisle target.</li>
        <li>Greenhouse body, staging depth, central aisle target and door access.</li>
        <li>
          Hot-tub service and cover-lift space, outdoor-kitchen work/service zones and
          play-equipment use zones.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <p class="garden-note">
      These tools use your measurements and assumptions. They do not check planning permission,
      drainage, foundations, wind loading, utilities, ventilation, fall surfaces or manufacturer
      safety zones unless you enter the exact manual dimensions. Play-equipment and hot-tub results
      are not safety assessments. This early utility page remains noindex pending source and search
      review.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-heading {
    padding-block: var(--space-7) var(--space-3);
  }

  .page-heading h1 {
    max-width: 26ch;
    margin-block: var(--space-1) var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--fs-3xl);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .page-heading > p:last-child,
  .garden-note {
    max-width: 80ch;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent-1);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .garden-services {
    max-width: 80ch;
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }

  .garden-services ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .garden-note {
    padding: var(--space-3);
    border-left: 0.2rem solid var(--color-accent-1);
    background: var(--color-surface-raised);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
  }
</style>
